  "goodToKnow": "Anbei means enclosed or attached, typical of formal letters and emails: Anbei finden Sie..., Anbei sende ich Ihnen... Style guides note that anbei with a verb like senden or finden is fine, though some find it stiff. Alternatives: im Anhang (in the attachment), beiliegend, als Anlage. Der Anhang is an email attachment."
